name: sys1
version: "@VERSION@"
origin: sysutils/sys1
comment: "Pool the spare power of every computer into one cloud"
www: "https://a-hackers-guide.github.io/sys1/"
maintainer: "289517818+A-Hackers-Guide@users.noreply.github.com"
prefix: /usr/local
abi: "@ABI@"
arch: "@ARCH@"
licenselogic: single
licenses: [UNLICENSE]
categories: [sysutils, net]
desc: <<EOD
sys1 pools the spare CPU, memory, disk and GPU of many computers into one
place to run websites, media servers, backups and AI models. It installs
sys0, a lowest-priority background client, and sys1, the node and its
dashboard.
EOD
